  <field_type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">event</field_type>
  <field_wiki_entry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">In 2164, an inland expedition attached to a Panamericana coastal authority discovered a long-obsolete but still functioning F-22 in a deep storage hangar in the Rockies.

Remembered mainly as a symbolic rediscovery of a lost military age, with a smaller but real reverse-engineering and reuse dimension.</field_wiki_entry>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

