  <field_wiki_entry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Panamericana land formation derived from naval infantry and specialized in cliff and mountain fighting.

Known for mobile alpine reconnaissance and strike operations, difficult-terrain recovery and expedition escort, and mountain-border guarding in regions such as the Rockies and Andes.
</field_wiki_entry>
