  <field_wiki_entry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Mixed late-CoG underclass gang rooted in one quarter but active as a smuggling and scavenging crew across sealed sectors. A member using inherited maintenance-line lore helped uncover the cracked vent route later used as a clandestine exit.

Historically important but mostly erased from official memory.</field_wiki_entry>
