  <field_wiki_entry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">! General

Project Deep Sleep orginated from the concern that centralization was a positive movement as a whole from a whole [[fac_ggo_hegemony]] perspective, however also put all eggs in one basekt.

In order to counter the potential for civilizational collapse due to a compromization of the central location, most wares produced by the GGOfoudn themselves present in [[idea_deep_earth_storage]] facilities.

! DES Sites
!! [[loc_des_1_underways]]
</field_wiki_entry>
