  <field_wiki_entry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">! Introduction

The Lübeck System is home to the [[fac_transfer_hansa]], where it first emerged. The system was handcrafted by the [[inst_cultural_seeding_group]] and the [[faction_terran_bdp]] before it to necessitate trade among planets in order to make survival viable and enjoyable. 

The systemw as chosen for its high number of medium to small planets of high density, providing relative viability terraformability. 

The system was terrfaormed by the [[faction_terran_bdp]], by a [[idea_terran_bdp_arks]]

() Choose Ark for this mission.


! Planets
!! [[loc_hemsbrook_l_beck_system]]
!! [[planet_br_gge]]

! Structures
!! [[Hanseplatz Station]]</field_wiki_entry>
