  <field_wiki_entry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Orbital-built Mars cargo transport vehicle used for high-volume freight transfer between Earth orbit and Mars orbit during the Race for Sol.

Designed as a larger follow-up to earlier Mars Delivery Vehicle concepts. Unlike earlier atmosphere-capable variants, MDV-3 is a pure space transport and does not perform atmospheric entry. It carries roughly 385 tons of cargo and operates between orbital infrastructure nodes rather than surface delivery points.</field_wiki_entry>
